    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cao_arcana_admin_operator_implementation_plan_execute_bridge",
      "label": "Orchestrator \u2194 CAO execute-bridge (mode plan | execute)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/cao-arcana-admin-operator-implementation-plan.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Endast steg m\u00e4rkta autoExecuteAllowed (L1\u2013L3 som passerar policy) f\u00e5r k\u00f6ras; dry-run-preview och OWNER-confirm f\u00f6r L3+ hindrar att orchestratorn exekverar fel steg."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cao_arcana_admin_operator_implementation_plan_auto_execute_false",
      "label": "Gr\u00e4ns: autoExecute=false och requiresOwnerApproval som default",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/cao-arcana-admin-operator-implementation-plan.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "St\u00f6rsta risken \u00e4r att CAO blir god mode och kringg\u00e5r gates; d\u00e4rf\u00f6r f\u00e5r agenten skapa utkast och flagga men aldrig aktivera mall i produktion, \u00e4ndra policy floor, sl\u00e4ppa patientkanal eller kringg\u00e5 L5 manuell intervention."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cao_arcana_admin_operator_implementation_plan_mvp_acceptance",
      "label": "MVP-acceptanskriterier vid slutet av Fas 2",
